- src/services/submit-reservations/apply-report-discounts.service.ts :: applyReportDiscountsService — This function computes the discount amount applied to each Mozio dispatch's report.price.discount. It matches discounts to dispatches by comparing dispatch.lineItems[].id (a composite key from getDispatchLineItemKey) against discount.lineItemId (the raw order line item ID). For return trips, the composite key differs from the raw ID, so the match fails and no discount is applied — causing the promo amount to be missing in the email.
